ad00662f7f35b445e73ddb8.webm?t=1788291976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212160/extras/ffeb35da1ad00662f7f35b445e73ddb8.mp4?t=1788291976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212160/extras/3c263618fa5fb894a3138846c7bb0b25.avif?t=1788291976\" width=580 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The corridors may appear disorienting. This is intentional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way through a facility that does not want to be mapped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to what you hear. Certain sounds are not to be investigated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the escape room before something else reaches you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212160/extras/508d7e44b1c4b8886b8831847e11ba8b.poster.avif?t=1788291976\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212160/extras/508d7e44b1c4b8886b8831847e11ba8b.webm?t=1788291976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212160/extras/508d7e44b1c4b8886b8831847e11ba8b.mp4?t=1788291976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212160/extras/dc0e8731e69a165ed4d3fb3b87ac8616.avif?t=1788291976\" width=580 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prisoners sent here are not expected to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, we acknowledge that some inmates, through cooperation, persistence, and an unhealthy level of curiosity, have attempted to do so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will not tell you it is impossible. We will simply state that no confirmed case of successful exit has ever been recorded. The outcome remains consistent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212160/extras/e21847ef0cc25cc3a8a36afeba529ac6.poster.avif?t=1788291976\" width=1170 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212160/extras/e21847ef0cc25cc3a8a36afeba529ac6.webm?t=1788291976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212160/extras/e21847ef0cc25cc3a8a36afeba529ac6.mp4?t=1788291976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note : Some inmates report hearing familiar voices. This is not to be trusted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212160/extras/f0326e81a97287eb1be2f441d1bbfb01.poster.avif?t=1788291976\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212160/extras/f0326e81a97287eb1be2f441d1bbfb01.webm?t=1788291976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212160/extras/f0326e81a97287eb1be2f441d1bbfb01.mp4?t=1788291976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Where the disappeared stay disappeared.</i> DOCUMENT DS-001 - DO NOT RETAIN - DO NOT SHARE - DO NOT REMEMBER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><strong>DEEPSCAPE INC.</strong></p>", "short_description": "2 to 4 player co-op horror game. You wake up marked with an ID number you can't see on your own back. Only your fellow inmates can read it. Find each other, share your numbers, reach your validation rooms, and get out before whatever roams the halls finds you first.&quot; en francais", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Japanese, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212160/7ec70aa24034a5c6e922e53e3ad624a02d54f341/header.jpg?t=1788291976", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212160/45749891c18540df5b08e2facaa93710c50ccae5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788291976", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212160/45749891c18540df5b08e2facaa93710c50ccae5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788291976", "website": "https://nightufo.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD RYZEN 5 5600x 4,60 GHz - Intel Core i5-7400 CPU @ 3.00GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVDIA GeForce GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Nobila", "Cynthia Le Friec"], "publishers": ["Night UFO"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id":